## How this repo is organised

This repo uses the [`agentic-research`](https://github.com/djjay0131/agentic-research)
plugin. Layout paths, venue facts, and deadlines live in **`docs/research-delta.md`** —
that file is the single source of truth, and every agent reads it. If you move a
directory, update the delta, not the agents.

The paper subtree holds **source only** — document, sections, figures and
scripts under `{{PAPER_DIR}}/`. Nothing is ever written beside `main.tex`:
`latexmk -outdir` sends the PDF and every `.aux`/`.log`/`.bbl` to `build/` at
the repo root. `files/` also sits at the root, shared with the code side.

| Path | What lives here |
|---|---|
| `{{PAPER_DIR}}/{{MAIN_TEX}}` | The document |
| `{{PAPER_DIR}}/sections/` | Section files, each with a `% WORD BUDGET:` header |
| `{{PAPER_DIR}}/{{BIB_BASENAME}}` | Bibliography |
| `{{PAPER_DIR}}/figures/` | Figures — `\includegraphics{name}` resolves here |
| `{{PAPER_DIR}}/scripts/` | Build, watch, wordcount, arXiv, Overleaf, checks |

| `{{CONSTRUCTION_DIR}}/design/` | Outlines and section plans, written before prose |
| `{{CONSTRUCTION_DIR}}/requirements/` | Citation matrix, submission checklist, CFP analysis |
| `{{CONSTRUCTION_DIR}}/sprints/` | Sprint plans and status |
| `{{MEMORY_BANK_DIR}}/` | Living project memory — read `activeContext.md` first |
| `files/` | Source material: the CFP, papers, notes. **Repo root, shared.** |
| `build/{{PAPER_DIR}}/` | The PDF and every LaTeX intermediate. **Repo root, git-ignored, derived** — delete it any time. |

