## Working on this paper

```bash
./{{PAPER_DIR}}/scripts/build.sh          # -> build/{{PAPER_DIR}}/{{MAIN_STEM}}.pdf
./{{PAPER_DIR}}/scripts/watch.sh          # rebuild on every save (Ctrl-C to stop)
./{{PAPER_DIR}}/scripts/watch.sh --view   # same, and open the PDF viewer
./{{PAPER_DIR}}/scripts/wordcount.sh      # words per section vs its budget
./{{PAPER_DIR}}/scripts/arxiv-package.sh  # arXiv tarball with the .bbl shipped
node {{PAPER_DIR}}/scripts/research-checks.mjs --compile   # full mechanical gate
```

## Agents

| Agent | Use it for |
|---|---|
| `{{LEAD_AGENT}}` | Leads this document type — outline, draft, revise |
| `latex-agent` | Compilation, formatting, `.bib` syntax, page counts |
| `citation-agent` | The citation matrix; verifying references are real and correct |
| `originality-agent` | Overlap, self-plagiarism, unverified claims — before submitting |
| `review-agent` | The merge gate: citations, compile, placeholders, page limit |
| `memory-agent` | End-of-session memory bank updates |

## Skills

| Skill | Use it for |
|---|---|
| `/research:add-paper <doi\|arxiv\|url>` | Add a verified reference to the bibliography |
| `/research:citation-matrix` | Rebuild and verify the whole citation matrix |
| `/research:originality-check` | Run the originality review |
| `/research:audit` | Check this repo against the plugin's current version |

## Ground rules

1. **Design before prose.** Sections get an outline in `{{CONSTRUCTION_DIR}}/design/` first.
2. **No citation without verification.** `citation-agent` verifies against Crossref,
   arXiv, or OpenAlex. A reference that resolves nowhere is treated as fabricated.
3. **Every number is re-derived by a human.** Agent output is a draft, never evidence.
4. **The build stays green.** `./{{PAPER_DIR}}/scripts/build.sh` must exit 0 before any commit.

